Archive members are fetched once every input is loaded, in rounds: each round fetches the members for the undefined
symbols in sorted order, and the undefined symbols the fetched members add wait for the next round, as Xcode 27.0's ld
loads them. lld fetched a member as soon as a symbol it defines was referenced, which loaded a strong definition
where Xcode's ld loads the member with the weak one first (swiftfin's _vlc_thread_set_name in libvlc.a; docs/formats/
build.md "Archive members").
